        "notes": "# Round one\nDuring this round, you wanna try and play aggressively to assert dominance. It's best to go with  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)  and  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) at this phase.\nYour main goal is to farm as much money as possible and reach at least 9,000-13,000 cash before the round ends.\nIf you're playing against a  [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) switch out  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) for [Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) .\n\nIf you go against a [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d), try to either play aggressively and pressure him or his backline. You wanna watch out for his Rock throw ability, as it can stun you mid slam.\n\nOther heroes you should watch out for would be  [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768), [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), and  [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) as they can interrupt your windup before your slam. The more you play this build, the better you can predict when they will use their counter abilities. This would build can 100% work if you play a numbers game. Counting cooldowns amongst the chaos.",
